WEBVTT

00:02.590 --> 00:05.010
<b>No!</b>

00:05.170 --> 00:07.090
<b>Let's go over there.</b>

00:07.220 --> 00:08.590
<b>I don't want to.</b>

00:08.720 --> 00:10.390
<b>Micchan doesn't want to.</b>

00:10.550 --> 00:15.720
<b>The teacher said we shouldn't
do things that make people sad.</b>

00:13.810 --> 00:21.980
<b>By that river
where I once caught fish</b>

00:19.100 --> 00:21.400
<b>Usa Eater-chan!</b>

00:22.020 --> 00:24.360
<b>Let's sing together!</b>

00:24.780 --> 00:26.990
<b>One, two.</b>

00:27.110 --> 00:36.120
<b>My dreams still wander</b>

00:36.250 --> 00:45.460
<b>And I cannot forget my hometown</b>

00:48.920 --> 00:51.470
<b>I love seeing everyone's smiling faces.</b>

00:51.840 --> 00:55.930
<b>Let's sing with Usa Eater-chan</b>

00:52.180 --> 00:59.940
<b>By that river
where I once caught fish</b>

01:00.230 --> 01:08.280
<b>My dreams still wander</b>

01:05.020 --> 01:08.280
<b>I'm happiest when everyone's having fun.</b>

01:08.690 --> 01:16.700
<b>And I cannot forget my hometown</b>

01:19.450 --> 01:21.620
<b>- Thank you!
- Yay!</b>

01:21.790 --> 01:25.460
<b>I'm so happy! My mom is a huge fan!</b>

01:25.590 --> 01:28.090
<b>- Can you do one for me too?
- Sure!</b>

01:28.210 --> 01:28.840
<b>But...</b>

01:28.960 --> 01:31.430
<b>Here, this is for you. Thank you.</b>

01:29.720 --> 01:32.050
<b>Lately...</b>

01:31.550 --> 01:34.140
<b>- Bye-bye!
- Bye!</b>

01:34.260 --> 01:36.930
<b>Usa Eater-chan's right next to us!</b>

01:34.970 --> 01:36.930
<b>Lately, I've been feeling...</b>

01:37.220 --> 01:39.390
<b>kind of strange.</b>

01:39.430 --> 01:40.980
<b>This one was great too!</b>

01:41.100 --> 01:41.770
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:42.140 --> 01:45.190
<b>Hey, do you want
to hear Yuno's new song?</b>

01:45.310 --> 01:46.980
<b>Yuno?</b>

01:47.820 --> 01:49.820
<b>Nana-chan said she liked it.</b>

01:49.940 --> 01:52.570
<b>- Wait a second.
- You don't know her?</b>

01:52.700 --> 01:54.280
<b>You have to listen now!</b>

01:54.660 --> 01:56.620
<b>It's a band that Yuno is in.</b>

01:56.740 --> 02:00.290
<b>She's the same age as us,
and she writes all the songs.</b>

02:00.410 --> 02:02.210
<b>The same age?</b>

02:09.090 --> 02:11.510
<b>Music by yuno</b>

02:14.720 --> 02:16.970
<b>Yay!</b>

02:17.550 --> 02:20.310
<b>"Nice song." It's cool, right?</b>

02:20.430 --> 02:24.100
<b>"I really like it." I love it too!</b>

02:24.230 --> 02:27.060
<b>"Nono-chan's been
full of energy lately."</b>

02:27.480 --> 02:28.150
<b>Yes!</b>

02:35.570 --> 02:38.080
<b>Yuno-chan and I are the same age.</b>

02:38.830 --> 02:41.120
<b>I wonder what she's like.</b>

02:42.200 --> 02:45.330
<b>This part's changed
from the previous contract.</b>

02:42.910 --> 02:45.330
<b>Members of a band or group</b>

02:45.580 --> 02:47.080
<b>- A band?
- That's right.</b>

02:47.250 --> 02:50.800
<b>We're still negotiating,
but this is the lineup.</b>

02:51.380 --> 02:52.260
<b>Yuno-chan!</b>

02:52.380 --> 02:54.930
<b>You play her songs on your streams.</b>

02:55.720 --> 02:58.890
<b>She was a freelancer,
but she recently joined us.</b>

02:59.010 --> 03:01.060
<b>Yuno-chan's one of the members?</b>

03:01.180 --> 03:03.350
<b>That's right. There's Fuji-san too.</b>

03:03.480 --> 03:04.730
<b>She's a manga artist.</b>

03:04.850 --> 03:07.810
<b>And Nakamachi-san.
We're about to sign her.</b>

03:08.150 --> 03:10.690
<b>We'd like the four of you
to form a band.</b>

03:12.360 --> 03:15.070
<b>"Dreams are power! (When you smile!)"</b>

03:14.070 --> 03:15.700
<b>"Magilulu Opening 'Nice Bulk' Cover"</b>

03:15.200 --> 03:17.910
<b>"Dreams are power! (Energy boost!)"</b>

03:16.030 --> 03:17.910
<b>So this is Arale-chan?</b>

03:18.030 --> 03:20.660
<b>"Dreams are power! (Let's live another day!)"</b>

03:20.620 --> 03:21.910
<b>A band...</b>

03:20.780 --> 03:23.700
<b>"Magical, Physical, Nice Bulk!"</b>

03:24.830 --> 03:26.830
<b>"Dreams are power!"</b>

03:25.460 --> 03:27.040
<b>A band!</b>

03:30.630 --> 03:33.130
<b>I've been in this world for 17 years.</b>

03:33.920 --> 03:36.130
<b>There's so much I don't know.</b>

03:36.510 --> 03:39.590
<b>It's fun being with everyone.</b>

03:40.140 --> 03:45.600
<b>I'm so happy and filled with love.
My heart is so full!</b>

03:45.890 --> 03:48.310
<b>Is it okay for me to be this happy?</b>

03:48.440 --> 03:50.110
<b>It's okay!</b>

03:52.690 --> 03:57.490
<b>Yuno-chan, Miyako-chan,
Arale-chan, and Ricchan...</b>

03:57.610 --> 04:01.490
<b>It feels like a dream that I get to
keep playing with them.</b>

04:01.620 --> 04:03.830
<b>I hate you!</b>

04:13.590 --> 04:16.010
<b>I'm quitting the band.</b>

04:23.720 --> 04:26.980
<b>The Yuno-chan
search party in the bath</b>

04:27.270 --> 04:29.100
<b>is a complete failure.</b>

04:30.190 --> 04:33.610
<b>Don't do things that make people sad.</b>

04:44.660 --> 04:46.240
<b>Hi! This is Nono-chan...</b>

04:46.370 --> 04:48.000
<b>This... this is terrible!</b>

04:48.160 --> 04:52.000
<b>Blissful Baths</b>

04:48.160 --> 04:50.330
<b>Yuno-san-chan's ascended to the skies!</b>

04:50.460 --> 04:51.540
<b>What?</b>

05:01.130 --> 05:02.840
<b>SubYuno: Bye-bye</b>

05:10.980 --> 05:15.480
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

05:16.650 --> 05:21.070
<b><i>The story always revolves around us</i></b>

05:21.400 --> 05:25.990
<b><i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i></b>

05:26.370 --> 05:31.370
<b><i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i></b>

05:31.540 --> 05:36.340
<b><i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i></b>

05:36.500 --> 05:40.380
<b><i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i></b>

05:40.510 --> 05:47.060
<b><i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i></b>

05:47.220 --> 05:51.940
<b><i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i></b>

05:52.270 --> 05:56.900
<b><i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i></b>

05:57.070 --> 06:00.740
<b><i>This is the plot of our survival</i></b>

06:01.070 --> 06:06.490
<b><i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i></b>

06:06.620 --> 06:11.120
<b><i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i></b>

06:11.410 --> 06:15.670
<b><i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i></b>

06:15.790 --> 06:19.000
<b><i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i></b>

06:19.130 --> 06:22.470
<b><i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i></b>

06:22.630 --> 06:25.800
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i></b>

06:25.930 --> 06:27.350
<b><i>Following the steady beat</i></b>

06:27.470 --> 06:32.390
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

06:33.480 --> 06:34.520
<b>Nono-chan!</b>

06:34.690 --> 06:36.020
<b>Oh, Ricchan!</b>

06:36.190 --> 06:40.440
<b>Yuno-san-chan's posts are getting
more and more depressing.</b>

06:40.570 --> 06:43.320
<b>What if she really ends up leaving?</b>

06:44.070 --> 06:44.900
<b>New post</b>

06:45.030 --> 06:45.660
<b>Drowning</b>

06:45.860 --> 06:48.410
<b>- Fish?
- An aquarium?</b>

06:49.280 --> 06:50.200
<b>"Drowning"?!</b>

06:50.370 --> 06:53.200
<b>Underwater? With a phone? Waterproof?</b>

06:50.950 --> 06:53.830
<b>If only we knew which aquarium...</b>

06:53.330 --> 06:54.370
<b>Tuna.</b>

06:55.000 --> 06:57.830
<b>Tuna-chan Quiz!</b>

06:58.000 --> 07:02.670
<b>Which aquarium in the area
can you see Tuna-chan at?</b>

07:02.800 --> 07:05.930
<b>Only here!</b>

07:06.090 --> 07:08.390
<b>Tuna-chan!</b>

07:09.050 --> 07:10.390
<b>Right now, Yuno-chan</b>

07:10.810 --> 07:13.390
<b>is with Tuna-chan!</b>

07:14.020 --> 07:14.940
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

07:15.140 --> 07:20.150
<b>Okay, hang tight,
Tuna-chan and Yuno-chan!</b>

07:23.400 --> 07:28.030
<b>Is it wrong to pressure someone
into staying when they want to quit?</b>

07:29.280 --> 07:30.580
<b>A field of flowers.</b>

07:31.080 --> 07:33.750
<b>Not everyone can thrive there.</b>

07:40.920 --> 07:42.340
<b>Nono-chan-san.</b>

07:44.460 --> 07:45.340
<b>Ouch!</b>

07:45.470 --> 07:46.680
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

07:49.680 --> 07:51.760
<b>Did it get through to you?</b>

07:52.470 --> 07:56.770
<b>That smooch you gave me back then
made me really happy.</b>

07:57.310 --> 07:59.980
<b>There's power in love.</b>

08:00.860 --> 08:02.190
<b>"Power"?</b>

08:03.570 --> 08:06.150
<b>So, let's go set a mousetrap
and catch her!</b>

08:06.280 --> 08:07.780
<b>Let's not call it that.</b>

08:07.950 --> 08:11.450
<b>Let's just go with confidence,
and if that doesn't work...</b>

08:11.570 --> 08:13.540
<b>we'll figure it out together.</b>

08:16.410 --> 08:17.210
<b>Thanks.</b>

08:18.120 --> 08:20.750
<b>- Ouch!
- You really got through to me.</b>

08:21.420 --> 08:23.040
<b>I'm going now!</b>

08:23.170 --> 08:25.460
<b>See you later!</b>

08:26.970 --> 08:28.130
<b>Wait, no!</b>

08:28.260 --> 08:31.930
<b>So where exactly is Yuno-san-chan?!</b>

08:29.510 --> 08:31.930
<b>What did she mean by a "smooch"?</b>

08:32.550 --> 08:33.970
<b>And a "mousetrap"?</b>

08:34.010 --> 08:37.480
<b>Smooch!</b>

08:48.400 --> 08:50.070
<b>This was for the best.</b>

08:51.950 --> 08:54.120
<b>I'm glad I left MewType.</b>

08:55.290 --> 08:59.290
<b>If I just treated the band like a job,
I could make it work.</b>

09:00.420 --> 09:01.750
<b>Or so I thought.</b>

09:04.670 --> 09:07.760
<b>We're the best band ever, aren't we?</b>

09:14.600 --> 09:20.100
<b>Yuno-chan!</b>

09:20.310 --> 09:25.020
<b>Found you!</b>

09:26.270 --> 09:30.610
<b>I searched all over for you.
You weren't even with Tuna-chan.</b>

09:30.740 --> 09:32.410
<b>I got you a moray eel.</b>

09:32.530 --> 09:33.490
<b>Why'd you come?</b>

09:33.620 --> 09:34.910
<b>Uh, why?</b>

09:35.160 --> 09:38.660
<b>We're nothing to each other.
I already quit the band.</b>

09:38.830 --> 09:40.370
<b>- But...
- Go away.</b>

09:46.920 --> 09:48.090
<b>Did you not hear me?</b>

09:48.710 --> 09:49.960
<b>Go home.</b>

10:12.110 --> 10:14.110
<b>You feel bad for me, right?</b>

10:14.530 --> 10:19.120
<b>You don't have to pretend to be nice.
Seriously, you can stop.</b>

10:22.960 --> 10:23.790
<b>Enough...</b>

10:26.000 --> 10:27.670
<b>Enough!</b>

10:27.840 --> 10:30.630
<b>Enough is enough!</b>

10:30.800 --> 10:32.420
<b>Everyone says whatever!</b>

10:32.760 --> 10:36.010
<b>"Go away," "don't talk to me,"
"I hate you,"</b>

10:36.140 --> 10:39.560
<b>"idiot," "stupid,"
"hypocrite," "brat."</b>

10:37.720 --> 10:40.970
<b>No one said those things.</b>

10:39.680 --> 10:41.720
<b>Everyone's just being selfish!</b>

10:42.140 --> 10:45.600
<b>I'm going to do as I like!</b>

10:45.900 --> 10:47.690
<b>I'm not leaving!</b>

10:47.860 --> 10:52.650
<b>And I won't leave
until you come back to the band!</b>

10:52.940 --> 10:55.490
<b>I won't.</b>

10:55.660 --> 10:59.990
<b>I'll stay here.</b>

11:00.620 --> 11:02.000
<b>Let go!</b>

11:03.330 --> 11:04.620
<b>Stop it.</b>

11:04.750 --> 11:07.420
<b>Hey, stop biting me. Stop it.</b>

11:07.580 --> 11:08.960
<b>Let go.</b>

11:07.880 --> 11:09.630
<b>Nono-chan-san.</b>

11:12.170 --> 11:14.970
<b>Yuno-san and...</b>

11:15.760 --> 11:17.470
<b>Nono-chan.</b>

11:18.300 --> 11:20.600
<b>What happened to you?</b>

11:21.600 --> 11:25.060
<b>Nono-chan, please let go of her.</b>

11:25.190 --> 11:27.230
<b>No!</b>

11:27.400 --> 11:30.230
<b>Are you Yuno-san-chan?</b>

11:27.560 --> 11:30.230
<b>Wake up. What we need right now is...</b>

11:30.570 --> 11:32.400
<b>It's our first real-life meeting,</b>

11:32.530 --> 11:34.360
<b>but it doesn't feel that way.</b>

11:34.490 --> 11:37.240
<b>You look even more stylish in real life.</b>

11:38.030 --> 11:41.030
<b>There's something
I've been wanting to tell you.</b>

11:41.160 --> 11:44.950
<b>You worked on "Memental Oparts," right?</b>

11:45.080 --> 11:47.460
<b>I absolutely love that ending theme!</b>

11:47.580 --> 11:51.540
<b>But the song credits
were kind of vague, right?</b>

11:51.670 --> 11:55.220
<b>So I only recently found out
you composed it!</b>

11:55.510 --> 12:00.050
<b>I really wanted to tell you
how I felt in person! Also...</b>

12:00.220 --> 12:01.430
<b>What a pain.</b>

12:02.640 --> 12:05.270
<b>I can't do this fake friendship stuff.</b>

12:05.810 --> 12:07.020
<b>I'm out of the band.</b>

12:07.480 --> 12:11.560
<b>I'll still write the music for you,
so just leave it at that.</b>

12:12.980 --> 12:14.230
<b>Yuno-san.</b>

12:15.190 --> 12:16.240
<b>Nono-chan.</b>

12:16.610 --> 12:19.490
<b>Is MewType the problem?</b>

12:21.160 --> 12:23.080
<b>It's not really MewType.</b>

12:25.330 --> 12:27.540
<b>We got that collaboration, right?</b>

12:28.250 --> 12:32.460
<b>The lyrics were written by someone
I used to be in a band with.</b>

12:41.260 --> 12:44.390
<b>- This is nice!
- Oh, the library prep room?</b>

12:44.510 --> 12:47.390
<b>- Our new secret base.
- That's one way to put it.</b>

12:47.560 --> 12:49.560
<b>Come on, it's nice!</b>

12:49.690 --> 12:52.900
<b>We need this.
We're starting a band, after all.</b>

12:53.060 --> 12:54.690
<b>What if a teacher sees us?</b>

12:54.820 --> 12:56.320
<b>We'll deal with it then.</b>

12:56.440 --> 12:58.650
<b>You wrote us a song, right?</b>

12:58.780 --> 12:59.950
<b>It's a work in progress.</b>

13:01.530 --> 13:04.330
<b>We've got a new song and a band name.</b>

13:04.490 --> 13:06.040
<b>First things first!</b>

13:07.500 --> 13:09.710
<b>- Cleaning?
- No, a live show!</b>

13:10.000 --> 13:11.170
<b>Obviously.</b>

13:12.210 --> 13:16.420
<b>Since it's our first show,
maybe we should make merch and stuff.</b>

13:16.590 --> 13:18.720
<b>- Like T-shirts?
- Right.</b>

13:18.880 --> 13:20.720
<b>1,000 T-shirts, 1,791,000 yen</b>

13:19.130 --> 13:20.720
<b>T-shirts are pricey!</b>

13:20.880 --> 13:23.720
<b>- Seriously?
- We don't need a thousand.</b>

13:23.850 --> 13:25.640
<b>Look for something cheaper.</b>

13:27.020 --> 13:28.180
<b>What?</b>

13:28.850 --> 13:31.890
<b>To be honest, I thought you'd say no.</b>

13:32.150 --> 13:34.770
<b>"A band member shouldn't be so flashy!"</b>

13:34.900 --> 13:37.190
<b>I don't sound like that at all!</b>

13:50.660 --> 13:52.120
<b>To our first show!</b>

13:52.420 --> 13:54.580
<b>- So tasty!
- That was so much fun!</b>

13:54.710 --> 13:56.750
<b>I'm still shaking.</b>

13:56.880 --> 13:58.760
<b>We were really incredible!</b>

13:59.300 --> 14:01.380
<b>More like, the best!
We totally stood out.</b>

14:01.510 --> 14:03.180
<b>Obviously.</b>

14:03.470 --> 14:05.640
<b>Wait, are you uploading it now?</b>

14:05.760 --> 14:08.430
<b>Didn't you want to double-check first?</b>

14:08.560 --> 14:10.810
<b>No, I can't wait another second.</b>

14:11.230 --> 14:14.560
<b>I want our music
out in the world right now.</b>

14:16.860 --> 14:17.690
<b>I'm done.</b>

14:17.900 --> 14:19.530
<b>That's really us.</b>

14:19.980 --> 14:22.530
<b>I want to make a living from music.</b>

14:23.740 --> 14:27.530
<b>- You can do it.
- Yuno's songs are amazing.</b>

14:27.660 --> 14:30.950
<b>The songs might be good,
but that's not it.</b>

14:31.750 --> 14:34.330
<b>I meant all of us, together.</b>

14:35.210 --> 14:37.790
<b>We're the best band ever, right?</b>

14:38.290 --> 14:42.010
<b>If we make it into the mainstream,
I know we'll sell well.</b>

14:42.300 --> 14:44.220
<b>We can even go global.</b>

14:46.340 --> 14:49.640
<b>Only Yuno would really mean
something like that.</b>

14:49.760 --> 14:51.680
<b>Let's go global, then!</b>

14:53.140 --> 14:56.190
<b>We're the best band ever, aren't we?</b>

14:57.900 --> 14:58.820
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

14:58.980 --> 15:02.150
<b>- I'm in too!
- Me too!</b>

15:03.320 --> 15:04.820
<b>Let's take on the world!</b>

15:04.950 --> 15:06.410
<b>Yeah!</b>

15:16.830 --> 15:21.500
<b>Scream it out, wherever you are
We're here, right now</b>

15:16.920 --> 15:18.880
<b>"supremacy band rehearsal room!"</b>

15:21.670 --> 15:27.430
<b>Strong enough to erase
this overflowing loneliness</b>

15:27.550 --> 15:32.470
<b>These frayed ends of hair
are a rebel's signal fire</b>

15:32.600 --> 15:39.020
<b>Take it in, take it in, and fight back</b>

15:37.440 --> 15:40.820
<b>We're going to make a living
from music together.</b>

15:41.610 --> 15:44.570
<b>Next year, and the year after that...</b>

15:45.190 --> 15:50.200
<b>In high school, after graduating,
and all the way to adulthood...</b>

15:51.280 --> 15:54.330
<b>We'll always be the best band ever.</b>

16:02.250 --> 16:05.590
<b>In the end, the band only lasted a year.</b>

16:06.260 --> 16:10.010
<b>Everyone wanted to quit
after finding their own dreams.</b>

16:10.140 --> 16:12.010
<b>As always, they were smiling.</b>

16:12.140 --> 16:14.220
<b>Didn't you try to stop them?</b>

16:14.350 --> 16:16.930
<b>It's pretty common for student bands.</b>

16:17.060 --> 16:20.810
<b>But wasn't going out into the world
a precious dream?</b>

16:20.980 --> 16:25.860
<b>Yeah, maybe we were all just caught up
in some kind of fantasy.</b>

16:28.860 --> 16:32.740
<b>I was the only one
who treated it as a real goal.</b>

16:33.280 --> 16:38.000
<b>We all had our own lives. It was naive
of me to expect that from them.</b>

16:38.460 --> 16:42.380
<b>That's why I didn't want to get
too involved with MewType.</b>

16:43.540 --> 16:47.970
<b>I thought I could handle it
as a business, but I couldn't.</b>

16:48.800 --> 16:51.140
<b>Sorry for messing things up.</b>

17:18.200 --> 17:21.330
<b>Let's sing together!
Come on, Miyako-chan!</b>

17:21.710 --> 17:23.290
<b>No, I...</b>

17:47.480 --> 17:49.860
<b>It's a song!</b>

17:49.990 --> 17:51.200
<b>Right, Nono-chan-san?</b>

17:51.320 --> 17:53.860
<b>Is it? Let me see...</b>

17:53.990 --> 17:55.910
<b>First, Miyako-chan!</b>

17:56.030 --> 17:56.740
<b>Yes.</b>

17:56.870 --> 17:58.330
<b>Bass drum!</b>

17:59.790 --> 18:01.580
<b>Like this?</b>

18:02.000 --> 18:03.210
<b>Nice!</b>

18:03.330 --> 18:05.290
<b>Yuno-chan, hi-hat!</b>

18:05.420 --> 18:07.210
<b>Huh? You mean this?</b>

18:07.880 --> 18:09.170
<b>Nice beat!</b>

18:15.970 --> 18:17.680
<b>What a horrible sound.</b>

18:26.110 --> 18:28.020
<b>Be quiet for a sec.</b>

18:29.280 --> 18:34.070
<b>New recording</b>

18:51.340 --> 18:53.340
<b>That's enough. Go on.</b>

18:53.920 --> 18:56.430
<b>Yuno-chan, give us the count.</b>

19:13.360 --> 19:16.240
<b>Yuno-chan, add the guitar too.</b>

19:16.360 --> 19:17.700
<b>Please.</b>

19:18.370 --> 19:19.160
<b>A riff?</b>

19:19.280 --> 19:21.410
<b>Like, "te-re-re, te-re-re."</b>

19:21.540 --> 19:23.450
<b>An arpeggio would be Ritsu.</b>

19:23.580 --> 19:24.620
<b>Yes.</b>

19:26.290 --> 19:27.290
<b>The riff? Okay.</b>

19:32.210 --> 19:33.300
<b>That's so cool.</b>

19:35.340 --> 19:38.010
<b>Will it sound weird if this goes higher?</b>

19:38.640 --> 19:40.100
<b>On keyboard...</b>

19:40.720 --> 19:42.810
<b>I want a heavy piano here!</b>

19:42.930 --> 19:45.390
<b>Tempo-wise, I'm not sure.</b>

19:45.520 --> 19:48.310
<b>Do you want to try it?
That could be interesting.</b>

19:54.030 --> 19:56.990
<b>- Avant-garde.
- It could use some refinement.</b>

19:57.110 --> 19:58.910
<b>You deleted the track.</b>

19:59.820 --> 20:01.660
<b>Let's add something sweet.</b>

20:01.830 --> 20:04.950
<b>- Marshmallows.
- Sugar's good for inspiration.</b>

20:05.410 --> 20:07.540
<b>MewType!</b>

20:07.670 --> 20:09.290
<b>I told you I quit.</b>

20:09.460 --> 20:10.710
<b>Nope.</b>

20:10.840 --> 20:14.590
<b>You only quit MewType 2.0.</b>

20:14.710 --> 20:17.930
<b>Now we're MewType 3.0!</b>

20:18.050 --> 20:19.550
<b>You never give up, do you?</b>

20:19.720 --> 20:22.810
<b>I'd say we're around 3.3
with song revisions.</b>

20:22.930 --> 20:23.720
<b>Meat!</b>

20:23.890 --> 20:25.180
<b>You're running wild.</b>

20:25.310 --> 20:27.060
<b>You taught me to do that.</b>

20:58.260 --> 21:00.340
<b>- Sounds good.
- Yay!</b>

21:00.930 --> 21:03.390
<b>I want to sing this at a live show.</b>

21:03.510 --> 21:04.810
<b>I get it.</b>

21:09.480 --> 21:11.020
<b>Nono-chan-san?!</b>

21:11.690 --> 21:14.400
<b>We'll keep being a band!</b>

21:14.570 --> 21:15.730
<b>Were you listening?</b>

21:15.860 --> 21:16.730
<b>I listened!</b>

21:17.110 --> 21:22.740
<b>And it just made me want to do MewType
with everyone even more.</b>

21:25.830 --> 21:27.290
<b>- I agree.
- Me too!</b>

21:30.000 --> 21:32.460
<b>You guys really do whatever you want.</b>

21:33.290 --> 21:35.290
<b>- Let's all go in!
- Nope.</b>

21:35.460 --> 21:38.590
<b>What? You're not getting away!</b>

21:37.090 --> 21:40.550
<b>- What's that?
- A sort of diary, I guess.</b>

21:38.710 --> 21:39.880
<b>Wait, why me?</b>

21:40.010 --> 21:43.800
<b>The sea is calling you!</b>

21:40.840 --> 21:43.800
<b>I'm keeping all the words we've shared.</b>

21:44.390 --> 21:46.810
<b>The sea is dangerous at night, so stop.</b>

21:45.850 --> 21:46.810
<b>I see.</b>

21:47.100 --> 21:48.430
<b>Maybe you're right.</b>

21:48.560 --> 21:51.270
<b>I kind of want to hop in too.</b>

21:51.390 --> 21:52.600
<b>Don't.</b>

21:55.860 --> 22:03.610
<b><i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i></b>

22:03.740 --> 22:07.540
<b><i>How will you live today?</i></b>

22:07.660 --> 22:15.540
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

22:19.550 --> 22:27.220
<b><i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i></b>

22:27.350 --> 22:34.940
<b><i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i></b>

22:35.730 --> 22:42.950
<b><i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i></b>

22:43.650 --> 22:51.330
<b><i>Come with us
To uncover the wonders of the universe</i></b>

22:52.960 --> 23:00.710
<b><i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i></b>

23:00.840 --> 23:04.550
<b><i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i></b>

23:04.680 --> 23:11.890
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:12.560 --> 23:19.480
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:25.610 --> 23:28.740
<b>- Yellowtail, tuna.
- Do you want sushi?</b>

23:30.030 --> 23:32.040
<b>Nono-chan-san's still feral!</b>

23:32.160 --> 23:33.370
<b>Seared salmon.</b>

23:34.000 --> 23:35.580
<b>Flounder fin, whelk.</b>

23:36.290 --> 23:37.960
<b>Next episode, "That was fun."</b>

23:38.080 --> 23:39.670
<b>Pickled ginger!</b>
